article is another identifiable scholarly contribution to the ring’s 
iconography, but only its bibliographic record and an AI-generated summary are 
present in the supplied material, so its specific conclusions cannot be used to
resolve authenticity.[3]\n\nThe provenance evidence remains a separate problem.
